WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.635
A lower price can look like a reason to act.

00:00:03.635 --> 00:00:05.650
But is it the same product?

00:00:06.350 --> 00:00:12.281
One kit. Six kits. A different pack can change the entire decision.

00:00:12.281 --> 00:00:14.317
Check before you match.

00:00:15.017 --> 00:00:21.140
Cut twenty dollars across five hundred units, and gross profit falls by ten thousand dollars,

00:00:21.140 --> 00:00:23.050
at unchanged cost and volume.

00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:29.437
PriceBriefs reviews up to five public product pages. Dated evidence.

00:00:29.437 --> 00:00:33.117
A prioritized fix order. One agreed recheck.

00:00:33.817 --> 00:00:37.070
Make pricing decisions on the right product.

00:00:37.070 --> 00:00:40.250
Request your five SKU audit at PriceBriefs.
